# Apple证书屏蔽验证 AntiRevoke（源自 salem-2007/apple-cert-block 的 Loon 插件，QX 规则集版）
# 用途：屏蔽苹果证书吊销/状态查询服务器，防侧载证书被吊销
# 用法：在 QX 的 [filter_remote] 里以 force-policy=reject 订阅本文件；在 QX 资源列表里可随时开关
# 注意：其中 ppq 两条会拦死 iOS 的「验证 App」——验证新装/续签的 App 前，先在 QX 里停用本规则集，验完再打开
HOST,ocsp.apple.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ocsp2.apple.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,valid.apple.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ppq.apple.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ppq-ext.v.aaplimg.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,crl.apple.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,certs.apple.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ocsp.digicert.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ocsp.digicert.cn,AntiRevoke
HOST,crl3.digicert.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,crl4.digicert.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ocsp.entrust.net,AntiRevoke
HOST,crl.entrust.net,AntiRevoke
HOST,ocsp.sectigo.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,crl.sectigo.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,ocsp.usertrust.com,AntiRevoke
HOST,crl.usertrust.com,AntiRevoke
